    "html": "<div class=\"c-donate c-donate--single no-bottom-margin o-module\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__top\">\n<h2 class=\"c-donate__title\">Do something amazing today</h2>\n<div class=\"c-donate__dropdown\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__choose-before\">I would like to make a </span>\n<div class=\"js-donate__choose c-donate__choose-single\">\n<span>one-off</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"c-donate__choose-after\">donation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__options-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__single c-donate__length c-donate__length--active\">\n<form action=\"https://donate.sightsavers.org/detect\" class=\"js-donate-form\" method=\"get\">\n<input name=\"gb_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026uk\"/>\n<input name=\"global_appeal\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"web2026gl\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__cards o-flex\">\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-1 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"1\" id=\"single-amount-1-1390728934\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"10\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-1-1390728934\">\n<img alt=\"Two health workers wearing surgical masks takes a blood sample from a young boy's finger..\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/2111_Mali_stop-MDA-surveys_river-blindness_blood-spot-sample_new-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£10</span>\n<p>could protect 50 families from river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input checked=\"\" class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-2 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"2\" id=\"single-amount-2-1390728934\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"33\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card c-donate__card--active o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-2-1390728934\">\n<img alt=\"An eye surgeon operates on a patient in hospital. Another member of clinical staff stands next to them wearing scrubs.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2303_Sightsavers-upendo-surgery-inclusive-eye-health-tanzania-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£33</span>\n<p>could pay for a life-changing adult cataract operation.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__select c-donate__single-loop-3 c-donate__single-sel\" data-id=\"3\" id=\"single-amount-3-1390728934\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"72\">\n<label class=\"c-donate__card o-flex-item\" for=\"single-amount-3-1390728934\">\n<img alt=\"Ophthalmic nurse Jeremiah Gwafa screens community members' eyes for trachoma.\" class=\"c-donate__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2002_Sightsavers-jeremiah-screening-community-binga-zimbabwe-580x326.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__card-bottom\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__amount c-donate-side__amount--£\">£72</span>\n<p>could protect an entire community from trachoma.</p>\n</div>\n</label>\n</input></input></input></div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-content\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--1\">\n<p>could protect 50 families from river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--active c-donate__mobile-text--2\">\n<p>could pay for a life-changing adult cataract operation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__mobile-text c-donate__mobile-text--3\">\n<p>could protect an entire community from trachoma.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<input name=\"Task\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Next\"/>\n<input name=\"Frequency\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"frqsingle\"/>\n<input class=\"single-amount-other\" id=\"single-amount-other\" name=\"singleAmount\" type=\"radio\" value=\"other\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-bottom\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-cont c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-wrapper\">\n<span class=\"c-donate__symbol c-donate__symbol--gb\">£</span>\n<label class=\"screen-reader\" for=\"custom-amount-donation-field-single--1390728934\">Enter custom donation amount, minimum  £ 2, maximum £ 10,000</label>\n<input class=\"c-donate__single-custom c-donate__custom\" id=\"custom-amount-donation-field-single--1390728934\" maxamount=\"10000\" maxlength=\"6\" minamount=\"2\" name=\"singleAmount_OtherAmt\" placeholder=\"Or enter your own amount\" placeholdertext=\"Or enter your own amount\" type=\"text\"/>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-min\">We're sorry, but the minimum donation we can take is £2</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__custom-error-max\">We're sorry, but we cannot process a donation of this size online. Please contact us on <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6f060109002f1c0608071b1c0e190a1d1c41001d08\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"650c0b030a25160c020d111604130017164b0a1702\">[email protected]</span></a> for assistance donating over £10,000</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-payment-options c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-donate__form-buttons c-donate__form-bottom-item\">\n<button <span=\"\" class=\"c-btn c-donate__btn--single c-btn--pay\" type=\"submit\">Donate £<span class=\"c-donate__single-btn-val\"></span> now\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</input></form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  }
